#
# https://help.github.com/articles/dealing-with-line-endings/
#
# These are explicitly windows files and should use crlf
# 所有文本文件统一LF
* text=auto eol=lf
# Windows 批处理脚本必须 CRLF（置于通配行之后才不被覆盖）
*.bat           text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
